---
title: Badge test
---

# Before upgrading the component

1. Start the first sentence with an action verb; it should not exceed one line and contain all the necessary information.

    1. Substep one: do this
    2. Substep two: do that
    3. Substep three: do more
    4. etc.

2. The second top-level step continues the procedure here.

3. A third step to confirm the numbering keeps going.
